  - `UserManager`: Add methods for changing passwords or retrieving user details.
  - `BookManager`: Include methods for editing or deleting a book. Define a structured way to read data to prevent issues while managing user and book data.

By addressing these weaknesses and implementing the suggested improvements, the overall functionality and user experience of the "VirtualBookPublishing" application can be significantly elevated, while adhering to the architecture constraints you've provided.
